  heading: "Commercial Asphalt Pothole Patching & Pavement Restoration"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      Potholes, alligator cracking, and sub-base failure create serious safety hazards and trip liabilities on commercial parking lots and private roads. S. Phaneuf & Associates offers full-depth sawcut asphalt patching and pavement repair services throughout Massachusetts.
    - >
      We sawcut deteriorated asphalt boundaries, excavate unstable subgrade gravel, compact fresh crushed stone, and install hot-mix binder and top-course asphalt compacted flush with surrounding pavement.
    - >
